<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_768e18f1eeabdbc60efa436a98e404979a7b66e6f8b22133183e14bad0dcbfba_n0085/e_0028> <http://digistrucmed.org/surfaceForm> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity/pacemaker> .
